error[SC0320]: this declares `malloc` unlike the library's
   ╭─[ a_library_function_declared_variadic_is_refused.c:1:7 ]
   │
 1 │ void *malloc(unsigned long long, ...);
   │       ───┬──  
   │          ╰──── declared here
───╯
  = note: C17 7.1.4 p2 permits declaring a library function without its header only with its own type, and this compiler reads a call to `malloc` as the library's, which takes an integer
